{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32852","headline":"送太学吴康仁及第南归 · 李频","name":"送太学吴康仁及第南归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"因爲太学选，志业彻春闱。\n首领诸生出，先登上第归。\n一荣犹未已，具庆且应稀。\n纵马行青草，临岐脱白衣。\n家遥楚国寄，帆对汉山飞。\n知己盈华省，看君再发机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}